    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A single entry in the schema audit log.</para>
<para>Each schema mutation (table create / update / delete, rollback, import) produces one entry stored durably under the key prefix <computeroutput>audit:schema:</computeroutput>.</para>
<para>JSON layout: { &quot;id&quot;: &quot;&lt;table&gt;:&lt;timestamp_ns&gt;&quot;, &quot;table_name&quot;: &quot;users&quot;, &quot;operation&quot;: &quot;create&quot; | &quot;update&quot; | &quot;delete&quot; | &quot;rollback&quot; | &quot;import&quot;, &quot;author&quot;: &quot;admin&quot;, &quot;description&quot;: &quot;added phone column&quot;, &quot;timestamp&quot;: &quot;2026-02-20T18:00:00Z&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: 2, &quot;metadata&quot;: { ... } // optional extra fields } </para>
    </detaileddescription>
